    },
    {
      "id": "mandatory-explanation",
      "title": "Why check this?",
      "visibility": "public",
      "sourceIds": [
        "pdf-six"
      ],
      "provenance": "source-derived",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "The six-page portfolio identifies missing WBS, dates and costs as a quality-control concern. In an interview, explain the grain of the record, the mandatory fields, the owner of an exception and whether a failed check blocks publication."
    },
    {
      "id": "date-query",
      "title": "Date logic",
      "visibility": "public",
      "sourceIds": [],
      "provenance": "synthetic",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "sql",
      "code": "SELECT wbs_code, revision_id\nFROM staging_schedule\nWHERE start_date > finish_date;"
    },
    {
      "id": "reconciliation",
      "title": "Define the comparison before the SQL",
      "visibility": "public",
      "sourceIds": [],
      "provenance": "synthetic",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Aggregate the same revision, currency and reporting scope on each side. Explain any tolerance and rounding rule. Do not compare the latest detailed estimate with a different baseline and call the difference a data error."
    },
    {
      "id": "exceptions-story",
      "title": "My contribution versus the system",
      "visibility": "public",
      "sourceIds": [
        "pdf-six"
      ],
      "provenance": "source-derived",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "The supplied portfolio describes maintaining project data, updating milestones, checking consistency, preparing views and supporting reviews. This reconstruction does not claim sole ownership of the platform."
    },
